# Ignore invisible
.*
*~
!.gitignore
!.github
!.markdownlint-cli2.jsonc
# deno.lock is tracked so CI can use --frozen and reject silent
# transitive bumps (issue #418).
run.log

# Common credential / secret filenames (issue #422).
# The `.*` rule above already covers dotfiles (.env, .aws/credentials,
# etc.), but plenty of secret-bearing files use non-dot names. Block
# the well-known ones at any depth so `git add .` cannot stage them.
config.json
credentials.json
secrets.json
service-account.json
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa
id_rsa.pub